<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>IKEA STAY ｜ 提案簡報</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700;900&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --black: #090C13;
    --card: #131827;
    --card2: #161c2d;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --yellow: #FFD100;
    --yellow-dim: rgba(255,209,0,0.12);
    --white: #F4F5F7;
    --muted: rgba(244,245,247,0.45);
    --dim: rgba(244,245,247,0.22);
  }
  html, body {
    width:100%; height:100%;
    background:var(--black); color:var(--white);
    font-family:'Inter','Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;
    overflow:hidden; cursor:default;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  /* ── COVER ── */
  #cover {
    position:fixed; inset:0;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:var(--black); z-index:100;
    transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
  }
  #cover.gone { opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transform:scale(1.04); }
  .cover-label { font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.3em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:28px; font-weight:500; }
  .cover-brand { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:clamp(52px,9vw,96px); font-weight:900; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:var(--white); margin-bottom:4px; }
  .cover-brand span { color:var(--yellow); }
  .cover-subtitle { font-size:clamp(12px,1.4vw,15px); color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.15em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:300; margin-bottom:48px; }
  .cover-line { width:48px; height:2px; background:var(--yellow); margin:0 auto 36px; }
  .cover-meta { font-size:12px; color:var(--dim); letter-spacing:.12em; text-align:center; line-height:2.1; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; }
  .start-btn { margin-top:40px; padding:14px 44px; background:var(--yellow); color:var(--black); font-weight:700; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; border:none; cursor:pointer; transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s; }
  .start-btn:hover { opacity:.85; transform:translateY(-1px); }

  /* ── PROGRESS / LABEL ── */
  #progress { position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px; background:var(--border); z-index:60; opacity:0; transition:opacity .4s; }
  #progress.show { opacity:1; }
  #progress-bar { height:100%; background:var(--yellow); transition:width .45s ease; }
  #slide-label { position:fixed; top:22px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.3em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--dim); opacity:0; transition:opacity .4s; pointer-events:none; white-space:nowrap; }
  #slide-label.show { opacity:1; }

  /* ── DECK ── */
  #deck { position:fixed; inset:0; opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .5s ease; }
  #deck.active { opacity:1; pointer-events:all; }
  .slides-wrap { position:relative; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; }

  .slide {
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
    padding:clamp(48px,6vw,88px) clamp(48px,8vw,128px);
    opacity:0; transform:translateX(60px);
    transition:opacity .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.8,.25,1), transform .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.8,.25,1);
    pointer-events:none; background:var(--black);
    overflow-y:auto;
  }
  .slide.active { opacity:1; transform:translateX(0); pointer-events:all; }
  .slide.exit { opacity:0; transform:translateX(-60px); }

  /* ── TYPOGRAPHY ── */
  .slide-eyebrow {
    font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.35em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--yellow); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:20px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
  }
  .slide-eyebrow::before { content:''; display:inline-block; width:28px; height:1px; background:var(--yellow); }
  .slide-heading {
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
    font-size:clamp(26px,3.8vw,50px);
    font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-.01em;
    color:var(--white); margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .slide-heading em { font-style:normal; color:var(--yellow); }
  .slide-body {
    font-size:clamp(13px,1.2vw,15px); line-height:1.9;
    color:rgba(244,245,247,.68); max-width:700px;
    font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; font-weight:300;
  }

  /* ── STAT ROW ── */
  .stat-row { display:flex; gap:48px; margin-top:44px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .stat-block { border-left:2px solid var(--yellow); padding-left:20px; }
  .stat-num { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:clamp(30px,3.5vw,44px); font-weight:900; color:var(--yellow); line-height:1; }
  .stat-label { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.08em; margin-top:7px; font-weight:400; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; }

  /* ── CARDS — 2-col grid, spacious ── */
  .cards {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap:20px; margin-top:36px;
  }
  .card {
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:32px 28px 30px;
    display:flex; gap:22px; align-items:flex-start;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
    transition:border-color .25s;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color:rgba(255,209,0,.25); }
  .card-icon-wrap {
    flex-shrink:0;
    width:44px; height:44px;
  }
  .card-icon-wrap svg { width:44px; height:44px; display:block; }
  .card-body {}
  .card-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--white); margin-bottom:10px; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.04em; }
  .card-text { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.85; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; font-weight:300; }

  /* ── PRODUCT CARDS — single col or 3-col wide ── */
  .prod-cards {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:20px; margin-top:36px;
  }
  .prod-card {
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:32px 24px 28px;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .prod-card-icon { width:40px; height:40px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .prod-card-icon svg { width:40px; height:40px; display:block; }
  .prod-card-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--white); margin-bottom:12px; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; }
  .prod-card-text { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.85; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; font-weight:300; }

  /* ── PAIN LIST — spacious ── */
  .pain-list { margin-top:36px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; }
  .pain-item {
    display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:28px;
    padding:28px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .pain-item:first-child { border-top:1px solid var(--border); }
  .pain-num { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:32px; font-weight:900; color:var(--yellow); opacity:.25; line-height:1; flex-shrink:0; width:40px; padding-top:2px; }
  .pain-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--white); margin-bottom:8px; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.03em; }
  .pain-desc { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.9; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; font-weight:300; max-width:680px; }

  /* ── QUOTE ── */
  .big-quote {
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
    font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,38px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--white); max-width:820px;
    position:relative; padding-left:40px;
  }
  .big-quote::before { content:'"'; position:absolute; left:0; top:-8px; font-size:72px; color:var(--yellow); font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; line-height:1; opacity:.55; }
  .quote-source { margin-top:24px; margin-left:40px; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.15em; text-transform:uppercase; }

  /* ── FEATURE-PAIN TABLE ── */
  .fp-table { margin-top:28px; width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; }
  .fp-table th { text-align:left; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); font-weight:500; padding:0 20px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .fp-table td { padding:18px 20px; font-size:12px; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; color:rgba(244,245,247,.7); line-height:1.7; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); vertical-align:top; }
  .fp-table tr:hover td { background:rgba(255,209,0,.025); }
  .tag { display:inline-block; padding:4px 11px; background:var(--yellow-dim); color:var(--yellow); font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }

  /* ── TWO COL ── */
  .two-col { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:48px; margin-top:32px; }
  .col-label { font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.25em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:20px; font-weight:500; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .col-item { display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .dot { width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--yellow); flex-shrink:0; margin-top:7px; }
  .col-text { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.85; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; font-weight:300; }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  #nav { position:fixed; bottom:28px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px; z-index:50; background:rgba(13,17,30,.88); backdrop-filter:blur(12px); padding:11px 22px; border:1px solid var(--border); opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .4s; }
  #nav.show { opacity:1; pointer-events:all; }
  .nav-btn { background:none; border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--white); cursor:pointer; width:34px; height:34px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:13px; transition:background .2s,border-color .2s; }
  .nav-btn:hover { background:var(--yellow-dim); border-color:var(--yellow); }
  .nav-counter { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.2em; min-width:40px; text-align:center; }
  #hint { position:fixed; bottom:88px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.18em; color:var(--dim); text-align:center; pointer-events:none; z-index:50; opacity:0; transition:opacity .4s; white-space:nowrap; }
  #hint.show { opacity:1; }

  .slide-overline { font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.35em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:400; }
  .slide-title-block { max-width:840px; }

  @media (max-width:780px) {
    .two-col,.prod-cards { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .fp-table th:nth-child(3),.fp-table td:nth-child(3) { display:none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- COVER -->
<div id="cover">
  <div class="cover-label">PROPOSAL DECK · 提案書 · 2026</div>
  <div class="cover-brand">IKEA <span>STAY</span></div>
  <div class="cover-subtitle">Living Space as a Service</div>
  <div class="cover-line"></div>
  <div class="cover-meta">
    提案對象：執行長 · 總經理 · 股東 · 投資人<br>
    預計時間：5 分鐘<br>
    設計學生提案 · 僅供學術用途
  </div>
  <button class="start-btn" onclick="startDeck()">開始簡報 →</button>
</div>

<div id="progress"><div id="progress-bar"></div></div>
<div id="slide-label"></div>

<div id="deck">
  <div class="slides-wrap">

    <!-- SLIDE 0: TITLE -->
    <div class="slide active" data-label="IKEA STAY · PROPOSAL">
      <div class="slide-title-block">
        <div class="slide-overline">A New Model for Urban Living · 2026 Proposal</div>
        <div class="slide-heading" style="font-size:clamp(34px,5.5vw,68px); margin-bottom:22px;">
          台灣年輕人<br>正在失去<em>自己的空間</em>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-body">
          高房價、小坪數、家庭壓力——越來越多人沒有一個地方可以真正屬於自己。<br>
          IKEA STAY，讓品牌從家具零售商，進化為生活空間的提供者。
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat-block">
            <div class="stat-num">78%</div>
            <div class="stat-label">20–35歲台灣人有空間壓力感</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-block">
            <div class="stat-num">NT$1.2T</div>
            <div class="stat-label">共享經濟市場年規模（台灣）</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-block">
            <div class="stat-num">0</div>
            <div class="stat-label">目前市場上有品牌信任的空間服務</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 1: INDUSTRY CHALLENGE -->
    <div class="slide" data-label="01 · INDUSTRY CHALLENGE">
      <div class="slide-eyebrow">01 · Industry Challenge · 業界的挑戰</div>
      <div class="slide-heading">台灣正在發生<br>一場<em>空間危機</em></div>
      <div class="slide-body">這不是房地產的問題。這是一個「人與空間脫節」的時代難題——而 IKEA 坐擁全球最強的生活品牌信任度，卻只停在賣家具這件事上。</div>
      <div class="cards">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <!-- Building/city icon: rising bars -->
              <rect x="6" y="26" width="7" height="12" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
              <rect x="17" y="18" width="7" height="20" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
              <rect x="28" y="10" width="7" height="28" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
              <!-- upward arrow on tallest bar -->
              <line x1="31.5" y1="8" x2="31.5" y2="4" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4"/>
              <polyline points="29,6 31.5,3.5 34,6" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <!-- floor line -->
              <line x1="4" y1="38" x2="40" y2="38" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-title">高房價擠壓居住品質</div>
            <div class="card-text">台北市平均房價所得比超過 16 倍，年輕人的家不再是「家」，而是一個睡覺的地方。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <!-- Shrinking square / floor plan icon -->
              <rect x="6" y="6" width="32" height="32" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.3)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/>
              <rect x="12" y="12" width="20" height="20" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.55)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/>
              <rect x="17" y="17" width="10" height="10" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="rgba(255,209,0,0.07)"/>
              <!-- compress arrows inward -->
              <line x1="9" y1="22" x2="15" y2="22" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.1"/>
              <polyline points="14,20 16,22 14,24" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none"/>
              <line x1="35" y1="22" x2="29" y2="22" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.1"/>
              <polyline points="30,20 28,22 30,24" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-title">坪數越縮越小</div>
            <div class="card-text">新成屋平均坪數從 35 坪降至不足 22 坪，客廳消失、書房消失、一個人的角落消失。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <!-- House + laptop overlap icon -->
              <path d="M22 8 L38 22 L32 22 L32 36 L12 36 L12 22 L6 22 Z" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <!-- laptop screen inside house -->
              <rect x="15" y="24" width="14" height="9" rx="1" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.7)" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none"/>
              <line x1="13" y1="35" x2="31" y2="35" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.4)" stroke-width="1"/>
              <!-- signal waves top right -->
              <path d="M34 12 Q36 10 38 12" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.5)" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none"/>
              <path d="M32.5 10 Q36 7 39.5 10" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.3)" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-title">WFH 模糊了家的邊界</div>
            <div class="card-text">遠距工作的普及讓家兼辦公室，但台灣大多數住宅根本沒有設計這件事。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <!-- Diamond / gem = value / opportunity -->
              <polygon points="22,6 36,18 22,38 8,18" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.4" fill="rgba(255,209,0,0.05)" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <polyline points="8,18 15,18 22,6 29,18 36,18" stroke="#FFD100" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none"/>
              <line x1="15" y1="18" x2="22" y2="38" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/>
              <line x1="29" y1="18" x2="22" y2="38" stroke="rgba(255,209,0,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-title">商機被嚴重低估</div>
            <div class="card-text">現有共享辦公、咖啡廳無法滿足「有生活感、有品牌信任感」的需求缺口，市場仍是空白。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 2: PROBLEM STATEMENT -->
    <div class="slide" data-label="02 · PROBLEM STATEMENT">
      <div class="slide-eyebrow">02 · Clear Problem Statement · 清晰的問題陳述</div>
      <div class="slide-heading">他們需要的<br>不只是<em>一張桌子</em></div>
      <div class="slide-body">目標族群：25–38 歲都市工作者，住在小坪數租屋、與家人同住、或剛搬出來的第一代自住族。他們的痛點不是「沒地方坐」，是「沒有一個地方讓人感覺活著」。</div>
      <div class="pain-list">
        <div class="pain-item">
          <div class="pain-num">01</div>
          <div>
            <div class="pain-title">空間焦慮 — 家像個倉庫</div>
            <div class="pain-desc">無法在家好好工作、放鬆、或招待朋友。空間不是生活，是生存的最低限度。這個感受透過社群媒體被大量放大，但沒有任何品牌正式承接。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pain-item">
          <div class="pain-num">02</div>
          <div>
            <div class="pain-title">咖啡廳疲勞 — 有壓力、沒歸屬感</div>
            <div class="pain-desc">咖啡廳是過渡，不是目的地。消費壓力、噪音、不能久待——人們需要的是可以真正「待」的地方，而不是不斷被提醒「你只是個客人」。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pain-item">
          <div class="pain-num">03</div>
          <div>
            <div class="pain-title">品牌真空 — 沒有值得信賴的空間品牌</div>
            <div class="pain-desc">WeWork 太商務、Airbnb 太短期、傳統共享辦公太功能導向。台灣市場缺少一個「生活感 × 可負擔 × 品牌信任」的第三空間。這個位置，IKEA 現在可以佔領。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 3: PROPOSITION -->
    <div class="slide" data-label="PROPOSITION">
      <div class="big-quote">
        我們不是在賣家具，<br>
        我們在定義<span style="color:var(--yellow)">你如何生活</span>——<br>
        現在，讓我們把這件事延伸到<span style="color:var(--yellow)">你的每一天</span>。
      </div>
      <div class="quote-source">— IKEA STAY · 核心主張</div>
      <div style="margin-top:52px; padding-left:40px; max-width:640px;">
        <div style="font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:14px;">驗證這件事存在</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(244,245,247,.65); line-height:2; font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif; font-weight:300;">
